      "wk-home-faq": {
        "type": "wk-home-faq",
        "settings": {
          "heading": "Frequently asked questions",
          "q1": "I'm not sure I'm in perimenopause yet — is this for me?",
          "a1": "Most likely, yes. Perimenopause can begin in your early forties — often before the word menopause feels like it belongs to you. If you're noticing changes in sleep, mood, or bloating, it was built for that window.*",
          "q2": "I'm already in menopause — is it too late for this to help?",
          "a2": "No. The transition doesn't end at your last period — hot flashes, night sweats, and disrupted sleep often continue for years beyond it. It works on the same systems whichever side of that line you're on.*",
          "q3": "Does it contain hormones?",
          "a3": "No. There's no estrogen, progesterone, or any hormone — it works through named botanicals, vitamins, and a probiotic blend that support your body's own systems.*",
          "q4": "Can I take it with HRT, birth control, or my medications?",
          "a4": "Every ingredient and dose is on the label, so you and your clinician can review it in full. Some botanicals can interact with certain medications and hormone therapies, so check with your provider first if you're on HRT or hormonal birth control, taking medication, pregnant, or nursing.",
          "q5": "Are there any side effects?",
          "a5": "It's hormone-free and sugar-free, dosed at researched levels, and formulated as a clean daily for the long transition. Some women notice mild digestive shifts in the first week as the probiotics settle in — that usually passes. If anything persists, check with your provider.",
          "q6": "How soon will I feel results?",
          "a6": "Many women report steadier sleep and a calmer stress response within two to three weeks, with the fuller picture by week eight as the actives reach steady state.*",
          "q7": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
          "a7": "Every order is backed by our 90-day money-back guarantee. Take the full three months, and if it isn't right for you, reach out for a full refund — no need to return the bottles.",
          "q8": "How does the subscription work?",
          "a8": "Your subscription ships free on your chosen cadence, and you can pause, skip, or cancel anytime from your account — no emails, no hoops."
        }
